NAME
    gcloud beta bigtable memory-layers - manage Cloud Bigtable memory layers

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud beta bigtable memory-layers COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (BETA) Manage Cloud Bigtable memory layers.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     describe
        (BETA) Describe a Bigtable memory layer.

     update
        (BETA) Update a Bigtable memory layer.

NOTES
    This command is currently in beta and might change without notice. This
    variant is also available:

        $ gcloud alpha bigtable memory-layers

